.TH PROFILES 1 2000-1月 "category_labels" "category_labels"
.SH NAME
category_labels \- Get the category labels for a given id set.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIcategory_labels(\fBcategory\fR as <generic> ClassProfiles, 
\fBidSet\fR as string, 
\fBlevel\fR as integer = 1, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the category labels for a given id set.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBcategory\fB \fR\- the KEGG category class model that is created by the \fBkegg_category\fR function.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBidSet\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the target id set
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBlevel\fB \fR\- the category level that will be returns: \fB1\fR (default) for the level 1 class, \fB2\fR for the level 2 category.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a character vector of the category label of each input id, a \fBNULL\fR value will be
 returned for the id that is not found in the category model.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
profiles
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
